  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "The original population is \\(12\\) students.\n\nIf the population doubles, the new population is\n\n\\[\n2(12)=24.\n\\]\n\nThe increase is\n\n\\[\n24-12=12.\n\\]\n\nRelative to the original population, the percentage increase is\n\n\\[\n\\frac{12}{12}\\times 100\\%=100\\%.\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{100\\%}\n\\]\n\n(If applying the stated tripling rule instead, the population would rise from 12 to 36, which is a \\(200\\%\\) increase.)",
